Subject: [ReXGlue] merge s6/h1

Class: RGO
What: The command processor no longer waits for background pipeline compiles; a draw with no ready pipeline holds its frame instead.
Evidence: Empty shader cache: hitches >= 100 ms 11 (worst 2.4 s) -> 2 (0.2 s) (PLAYBOOK Session 6).
On / off: vulkan_pipeline_no_submit_wait (+_verify), vulkan_pipeline_sync_depth_only, off.
Commit: 7924ce3 (diff against 7924ce3^1)
Prepared by the WWE 2K14 recomp project (Session 15, prep only, not sent). Measured on one PC (Ryzen 9 5950X, RTX 4090), Vulkan backend, one title.

